      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Sherman was incorporated in 1802, becoming an independent town after separating from New Fairfield.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sherman%2C_Connecticut",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1991, Sherman earned historic district status for its architecture, including houses, the town hall, school, and manufacturing facilities.",
